    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just the struggle part of it. the constant effort to be \"different\" from my family just feels like running on a treadmill. if the outcome is inevitable, isn't the \"choice\" to keep fighting just more unnecessary suffering? it feels like i'm just fighting a losing battle against my own nature.",
